#. module: stock_orderpoint_other_locations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_orderpoint_other_locations.field_stock_warehouse_orderpoint__other_location_ids
msgid ""
"\n"
"        When set, locations filled are taken in account when calculating\n"
"        available and virtual quantities, during procurement rules execution.\n"
"        Then, obtained quantities for these locations are added to available\n"
"        stock count and should prevent firing rules\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Se tienen en cuenta las ubicaciones indicadas cuando se calculan las\n"
"        existencias disponibles y virtuales, cuando se ejecutan las reglas del planificador.\n"
"        Las cantidades obtenidas se consideran como disponibles a mayores,\n"
"        evitando que se lancen las reglas si hay stock suficiente\n"
"        "

